## Current Behavior

Lua scripts exist at `/home/ritz/games/azeroth-core/lua-scripts/` and are
symlinked into the server's lua_scripts directory. This creates risk of
accidental data overwriting if the shared location is modified.

Source location has its own git history (119 commits in custom/.git).

## Intended Behavior

Scripts are copied (not symlinked) into this project at `src/lua/` with:
1. Full ownership by this repository
2. Preserved functionality
3. Clear documentation of what each module does

