## System Overview

```
On Player Login:
├── Setup queues (ambush, treasure)
├── Register periodic events:
│   ├── Every 40s:  PeriodicSpawnAmbush
│   ├── Every 130s: PeriodicSpawnTravellers
│   └── Every 100s: PeriodicSpawnTreasure
└── If dead: join spirit world, wait for res

PeriodicSpawnAmbush:
├── Skip if: sitting, dead, in water, 3+ ambushers, boss fight
├── Query DB for level-appropriate mobs
├── Spawn 120-160 units away
└── Creature chases player, attacks when close

PeriodicSpawnTreasure:
├── Skip if: sitting, dead, in water
├── Select level-appropriate chest from queue
└── Spawn 20-35 units away
```

